<title>POLAND: Optimus H1 net profit rises to PLN 5.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Optimus H1 net profit rises to PLN 5.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optimus SA results for period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						H1 1996     H1 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			9.66  vs    5.26</p>
<p>    pre-tax				   9.57  vs    7.29</p>
<p>    net					 5.65  vs    4.39</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Optimus SA. @</p>
<p>    net sales			     188.53  vs  119.15</p>
<p>    costs of sales			165.70  vs  104.61</p>
<p>    extraordinary			   0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    income tax				4.03  vs    2.80</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00  vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		    3.40  vs    2.23</p>
<p>    financial costs			 3.49  vs    0.74</p>
<p>    depreciation			    1.31  vs    0.97</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
